The desk merged different mechanisms under one ticket. The [signed review and replacement decision](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause) separates the [shared parser](https://github.com/asledziewski/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1) from the [booking-v3 hint](https://github.com/asledziewski/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2). Those challenge tickets record the analysis and KB handoff; their closure does not establish that production fixes shipped.

<Callout>
Engineering update, 2026-10-05: parser fixed (parse dd/mm for eu locales); hint will not be fixed because booking-v3 was retired. Parser ticket: completed. Hint ticket: not planned. Exceptional timing evidence remains unresolved. See the [signed outcome review](/kb/incidents/4471-review).
</Callout>

